  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hamro Sahas: Feminist Movement Building for Social Norm Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this programme is gender discriminatory attitudes, behaviours, and social norms (including caste-based discrimination) are transformed in communities where women, girls, marginalised groups, and their networks (including women rights organizations) increasingly participate in and benefit from gender-responsive and inclusive governance processes and human rights in Nepal.</narrative>
  </description>
